## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Snowball Tempo (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Sky Piercer, Windtalker, Endless Battle, War Axe, Malefic Roar
- Core: Sky Piercer, Windtalker, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Swift Boots when Use when magic burst or chain control stops Roger before he can switch forms and finish the chase.; Sea Halberd over War Axe when Use when sustain, shields, or high-extra-HP front liners are keeping Roger's first target alive.; Blade of Despair over War Axe when Use when you are ahead and the team needs a stronger low-HP execute window instead of bruiser uptime.; Immortality over Malefic Roar when Use before final Lord fights when one failed pounce would otherwise end the game.
- Total cost: 10580 gold

Default jungle setup for snowball games. Sky Piercer and Windtalker accelerate early kills, while Endless Battle and Ice Retribution keep Roger connected after Open Fire starts the chase.

### Jungle On-Hit Frontline (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Bloody Retribution
- Flex: Swift Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft lacks hard control and Roger can safely race to his attack-effect spike.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use against healer or shield drafts when Lifebane matters more than armor-stacking damage.; Wind of Nature over Immortality when Use against physical burst that reaches Roger before Lycan Pounce can dodge the key hit.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst or mixed dive where a delayed revive will not create a playable second entry.
- Total cost: 11110 gold

Front-to-back jungle setup for tankier drafts. Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, and Golden Staff let Roger keep triggering attack effects before wolf form cleans up low-health targets.

### Gold Lane Crit Inspire (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Windtalker, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Great Dragon Spear, Malefic Roar
- Core: Windtalker, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Tough Boots over Swift Boots when Use when lane control is decided by magic poke, slows, or repeated crowd control instead of raw DPS.; Wind of Nature over Great Dragon Spear when Use against physical divers or enemy marksmen who can force Roger out before he commits to wolf form.; Rose Gold Meteor over Great Dragon Spear when Use when magic burst is the main reason Roger cannot hold a side-lane angle.; Sea Halberd over Great Dragon Spear when Use when lifesteal, healing, or shields are letting the enemy gold laner survive Roger's first all-in.
- Total cost: 11200 gold

Gold-lane fallback for drafts where Roger is not the Retribution user. Inspire and crit items turn human-form poke into a real DPS threat before wolf form finishes the trade.

